ROB-21a: Cancel maintenance sweeps between aspects (#664)

Add MaintenanceCancel(Arc<AtomicBool>) token with Default/Clone/request/is_requested.
Each of the 8 store-wide sweep methods gets a `*_with_cancel` variant. The original
methods delegate to the cancel variant with a never-requested default token so existing
callers in weft-server are untouched.

The check runs between aspects, before the aspect's maintenance guard is acquired, at
the same seam as breaker_permits. The in-flight aspect always completes and is counted
normally.

Tests A1–A3 from the brief:
- A1: cancel_between_aspects_finishes_current_and_reports_cancelled
- A2: cancel_before_sweep_starts_nothing
- A3: cancelled_sweep_then_full_sweep_converges

